{"seq":3,"slug":"resolv-conf-stub-search-ndots-ops","title":"存根配置实操：resolv.conf、search/ndots、EDNS0 截断与 TCP 回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dns-resolver-recursive-caching-internals-coredns/dns-resolution-chain-resolver-types/resolv-conf-stub-search-ndots-ops","wordCount":2461,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"存根配置实操-resolv-conf-search-ndots-edns0-截断与-tcp-回退\">存根配置实操：resolv.conf、search/ndots、EDNS0 截断与 TCP 回退</h1><p>存根解析器（stub resolver）在 Linux 上不是守护进程，而是 libc 里的一组例程——<code>getaddrinfo()</code>、<code>res_query()</code> 被调用时才第一次读取 <code>/etc/resolv.conf</code>，随后把解析结果、搜索列表、重试计数全部缓存在进程内存里。这意味着两件工程事实：第一，改文件后新起的进程才生效（除非设了 <code>no-reload</code> 之外的行为，见下文）；第二，容器里那份 <code>resolv.conf</code> 是编排系统注入的，语义与你手写的不同。本文把这份文件从指令语义讲到线上实证，覆盖 ndots 展开算法与 EDNS0 缓冲协商这两处最容易踩坑的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>存根解析器与递归解析器是两套完全不同的东西：存根只做「搜索列表拼接 + 转发 + 重试」，不做迭代查询；递归解析器（CoreDNS、Unbound、BIND）才做根/顶级/权威的逐级追查。<code>/etc/resolv.conf</code> 配置的是前者。两类角色的职责边界与 RD/RA 标志位见同章 <a href=\"stub-recursive-iterative-resolver-model\">存根 / 递归 / 迭代解析器类型与查询链建模</a>；存根把查询交给递归器之后，递归器如何从根逐级委派追问，见 <a href=\"delegation-referral-glue-iteration\">根/TLD/权威委派、referral 与胶水记录的迭代查询机制</a>。本文只覆盖存根这一侧的配置语义与线上调参。</p>\n<p>一次 <code>getaddrinfo(&quot;api&quot;)</code> 调用在存根层要经过三层决策：<strong>名字补全</strong>（search 列表 + ndots 阈值决定发几个候选名）、<strong>传输选择</strong>（UDP 带 EDNS0 缓冲区声明，超长则退 TCP）、<strong>重试编排</strong>（<code>timeout</code> × <code>attempts</code> × <code>nameserver</code> 数量）。三层的默认值都不显眼，但它们的乘积决定了一次解析失败要等多久。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;getaddrinfo(api)&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;候选名数量&lt;br/&gt;(search + ndots)&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;gen 多个 FQDN&quot;| C[&quot;逐个候选发出查询&lt;br/&gt;UDP + EDNS0 OPT&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;响应 TC 位?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| E[&quot;返回结果&lt;br/&gt;写入进程内缓存&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;是(截断)&quot;| F[&quot;改用 TCP 53&lt;br/&gt;重发同一查询&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; G{&quot;N 个 nameserver&lt;br/&gt;均超时?&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;尝试 attempts 次&quot;| H[&quot;RES 返回错误&lt;br/&gt;调用方拿 EAI_AGAIN&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"getaddrinfo(api)\"] --&gt; B{\"候选名数量&lt;br/&gt;(search + ndots)\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"gen 多个 FQDN\"| C[\"逐个候选发出查询&lt;br/&gt;UDP + EDNS0 OPT\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"响应 TC 位?\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"否\"| E[\"返回结果&lt;br/&gt;写入进程内缓存\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"是(截断)\"| F[\"改用 TCP 53&lt;br/&gt;重发同一查询\"]\n    F --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; G{\"N 个 nameserver&lt;br/&gt;均超时?\"}\n    G --&gt;|\"尝试 attempts 次\"| H[\"RES 返回错误&lt;br/&gt;调用方拿 EAI_AGAIN\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>glibc 默认值</th>\n<th>上限/行为</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>nameserver</code></td>\n<td>本地主机（文件缺失时）</td>\n<td>最多 3 个（<code>MAXNS</code>）</td>\n<td>第 4 条起被静默忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>search</code></td>\n<td>主机名第一个 <code>.</code> 之后的域</td>\n<td>glibc ≥2.26 无长度上限</td>\n<td>每条 search 会放大候选名数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ndots:n</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>静默截断到 15</td>\n<td>决定补全优先还是绝对查询优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>timeout:n</code></td>\n<td>5 秒</td>\n<td>静默截断到 30</td>\n<td>单个上游的等待上限，非整体上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>attempts:n</code></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>静默截断到 5</td>\n<td>一轮完整重试的次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rotate</code></td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>轮询上游</td>\n<td>分摊首条 nameserver 的压力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>edns0</code></td>\n<td>关闭（须显式开）</td>\n<td>启用 RFC 2671 扩展</td>\n<td>打开后才谈得上大缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：Linux <code>resolv.conf(5)</code> man page（man7.org）。注意 <code>timeout</code> 那行是「静默截断」而非报错——写 <code>timeout:60</code> 不会失败，只会被当 30 用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"resolv-conf-关键指令与-glibc-版本差异\">resolv.conf 关键指令与 glibc 版本差异</h2><p>除上表外，几个指令的版本节点决定了它们在老镜像上的行为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>single-request</code>（glibc 2.10 起）与 <code>single-request-reopen</code>（2.9 起）：默认 glibc 会并行发 A 与 AAAA 查询以省时间，但某些防火墙/负载设备会把同一源端口的两条查询当成重复而只回一条，客户端于是死等第二条。这两个选项改成串行（reopen 还额外换一次 socket），是「偶发解析缓慢」的经典修复。</li>\n<li><code>use-vc</code>（2.14 起）：强制所有解析走 TCP，等于全局关掉 UDP 截断路径，调试时有用但吞吐代价明显。</li>\n<li><code>no-tld-query</code>（2.14 起）：禁止把不带点的名字当顶级域解析，防止 <code>getaddrinfo(&quot;local&quot;)</code> 意外命中根区的 TLD。</li>\n<li><code>no-aaaa</code>（2.36 起）：抑制存根发出的 AAAA 查询，作为诊断手段——但 man page 明确注明它<strong>与 EDNS0 用法和 DNSSEC 校验不兼容</strong>，且为生成正确的 NXDOMAIN 会把 AAAA 查询改写成 A 查询。</li>\n<li><code>trust-ad</code>（2.31 起）：把上游应答里的 AD 位原样透传给应用。默认情况下存根会清掉 AD 位，所以依赖 AD 做 DNSSEC 判断的应用必须显式开启——这也意味着存根的 <code>resolv.conf</code> 被当作可信来源。</li>\n<li><code>no-reload</code>（2.26 起）：关闭配置文件变更后的自动重载。默认 glibc 会按修改时间检查并重载，这对挂载了动态生成的 <code>resolv.conf</code> 的容器反而可能是不必要的开销。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"search-列表与-ndots-n-的展开算法\">search 列表与 ndots:n 的展开算法</h2><p>这是存根层唯一的「算法」，也是最常导致解析延迟的地方。规则（<code>resolv.conf(5)</code>）：名字里点的数量<strong>少于</strong> <code>ndots</code> 时，先按 search 列表逐个拼接尝试，直到命中；点的数量<strong>不少于</strong> <code>ndots</code> 时，先当作绝对名（FQDN）查询一次。</p>\n<p>设候选集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，原始名为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，其点数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，search 列表为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = [s_1, s_2, \\dots, s_k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>ndots</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mtext>ndots</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\begin{cases}\n\\{n \\cdot s_1, \\dots, n \\cdot s_k, n\\} &amp; d &lt; \\text{ndots} \\\\\n\\{n, n \\cdot s_1, \\dots, n \\cdot s_k\\} &amp; d \\ge \\text{ndots}\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ndots</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ndots</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即：<code>ndots</code> 只改变<strong>顺序</strong>，不改变最终的候选集合——两者都包含绝对名与全部 search 后缀，只是谁先谁后的差别。代价因此是可量化的：一次逻辑查询最多产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个候选名，每个候选名又要遍历最多 3 个 nameserver、重试最多 <code>attempts</code> 次。最坏等待时间上界为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>attempts</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>timeout</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>nameserver</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\max} \\approx (k+1) \\times \\text{attempts} \\times \\min(\\text{timeout}, 30) \\times \\min(\\text{nameserver}, 3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attempts</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">timeout</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nameserver</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以默认值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> attempts</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> timeout</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=1,\\ \\text{attempts}=2,\\ \\text{timeout}=5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attempts</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">timeout</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 为例，单个候选名最坏 10 秒，两个候选名就是 20 秒——远超过常见的 5 秒应用超时。工程结论很直接：<strong>第二个 search 后缀之所以是「性能税」，是因为它在第一个后缀 NXDOMAIN 后仍要再走一遍完整重试。</strong></p>\n<p>Kubernetes 把这个数放大得更明显。kubelet 为每个 Pod 注入的 <code>resolv.conf</code> 是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"nameserver 10.32.0.10&#10;search &lt;namespace&gt;.svc.cluster.local svc.cluster.local cluster.local&#10;options ndots:5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>nameserver 10.32.0.10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>search &#x3C;namespace>.svc.cluster.local svc.cluster.local cluster.local</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>options ndots:5</span></span></code></pre></div><p>来源：Kubernetes 官方文档 <em>DNS for Services and Pods</em>。<code>ndots:5</code> 是刻意的——集群内短服务名（如 <code>data</code>）的 FQDN 是 <code>data.&lt;ns&gt;.svc.cluster.local</code>，有 4 个点，低于 5，于是走补全路径，先拼 search 列表命中集群内服务；而外部域名如 <code>api.stripe.com</code> 只有 2 个点，同样低于 5，于是也必须先试 3 个 search 后缀。这就是「Pod 里解析外部域名比宿主机慢」的根因：不是网络慢，是三个必然 NXDOMAIN 的候选名排在前面。缓解手段是把 <code>ndots</code> 调低（但会破坏短服务名解析），或对已知外部域名写完整的带尾点的 FQDN（<code>api.stripe.com.</code> 带尾点表示绝对名，直接跳过一切补全）——尾点是本文最实用的一条技巧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"edns0-缓冲协商-tc-截断与-tcp-回退\">EDNS0 缓冲协商、TC 截断与 TCP 回退</h2><p>RFC 1035 §4.2.1 定义 UDP 载荷上限为 <strong>512 字节</strong>，超出即截断并置 TC 位：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Messages carried by UDP are restricted to 512 bytes (not counting the IP or UDP headers). Longer messages are truncated and the TC bit is set in the header.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>EDNS0（RFC 6891）用 OPT 伪 RR 把这个上限变成可协商：请求方把「我能重组并交付的最大 UDP 载荷字节数」写进 OPT 记录的 CLASS 字段，响应方据此决定是否截断。两条硬规则：低于 512 的值 <strong>MUST</strong> 按 512 处理；请求方<strong>不应</strong>声明自己无法接收的值，躲在会丢分片 IP 包的防火墙后面时更应保守。</p>\n<p>1232 这个数字不是随意的，它由最小 IPv6 MTU 反推：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>MTU</mtext><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>IPv6</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>UDP</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1280</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1232</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\max} = \\text{MTU}_{\\min} - H_{\\text{IPv6}} - H_{\\text{UDP}} = 1280 - 40 - 8 = 1232\\ \\text{字节}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTU</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IPv6</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">UDP</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1280</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1232</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>同样地，以太网 IPv4 路径上是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1500</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1472</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1500 - 20 - 8 = 1472</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1472</span></span></span></span></span>。取 1232 是因为它同时满足 IPv4 与 IPv6 而不触发分片。DNS Flag Day 2020 正是把各实现的默认 EDNS 缓冲区统一到这个值，其官方说明引用 NLnet Labs 的 Koolhaas 与 Slokker 的 <em>Defragmenting DNS</em> 研究，结论是「软件默认值应反映最小安全尺寸 1232」（dnsflagday.net/2020）。ISC 的同期文章把推荐值表述为「略小于 IPv6 最小分片尺寸，约 1220–1232 字节」，并强调两条必须同时满足的条件：要么保证所有响应都塞进约 1220 字节，<strong>要么</strong>客户端与服务器都必须能走 TCP。</p>\n<p>对照实现默认值可以验证这一共识已落地：Unbound 的 <code>unbound.conf</code> 中 <code>edns-buffer-size</code> 默认 1232（文档原文标注 <em>DNS Flag Day 2020 recommendation</em>），<code>max-udp-size</code> 默认同为 1232，且文档建议取值区间为 512–4096。</p>\n<p>回退路径本身在存根与转发层各有一半。存根侧收到 TC=1 的应答后改用 TCP 53 重发同一查询（RFC 1035 规定 TC 只表示「本消息被截断」，不表示错误）。转发层则需要显式配置才能保证行为一致——CoreDNS <code>forward</code> 插件提供了几个关键旋钮：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>forward 选项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>何时用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>force_tcp</code></td>\n<td>一律用 TCP 与上游通信</td>\n<td>上游 UDP 路径有分片问题、或要求 TCP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prefer_udp</code></td>\n<td>优先 UDP，截断才退 TCP（默认行为）</td>\n<td>常规场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_fails</code></td>\n<td>判定上游不健康的失败次数；设 0 关闭健康检查</td>\n<td>上游偶发抖动时放宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>health_check DURATION</code></td>\n<td>健康探测周期；<code>no_rec</code> 关闭递归位</td>\n<td>需要控制探测流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>policy random|round_robin|sequential</code></td>\n<td>多上游选择策略</td>\n<td>分摊负载或保证顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>except</code></td>\n<td>排除某些域名不转发</td>\n<td>集群内域与外部域分流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：CoreDNS 官方插件文档 <em>forward</em>。<code>max_fails: 0</code> 的语义值得单独记：文档明确「设 0 则不执行检查，上游永远被视为健康」，当所有上游都被判死时插件会退回随机挑一个——所以关掉健康检查是「永不熔断」而非「永不失败」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>存根解析器是 libc 例程，不是守护进程；配置在进程内首次调用时读取并缓存。</li>\n<li><code>ndots</code> 只改变候选名的<strong>顺序</strong>，绝对名与全部 search 后缀始终都在候选集合中；代价上界可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>attempts</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>timeout</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(k+1) \\times \\text{attempts} \\times \\text{timeout}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attempts</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">timeout</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>Kubernetes 的 <code>ndots:5</code> 让外部域名也先过 3 个 search 后缀，这是 Pod 内解析外网偏慢的结构性原因；带尾点的 FQDN 可绕过全部补全。</li>\n<li>512 字节是 RFC 1035 的历史上限，EDNS0 把它变成可协商；1232 = 1280 − 40 − 8，是同时不触发 IPv4/IPv6 分片的安全默认值，已被 DNS Flag Day 2020 与 Unbound 等实现采纳。</li>\n<li>TC=1 触发 UDP→TCP 回退，这条路径必须先验证可用：上游或中间设备封 TCP 53 时，大响应（含 DNSSEC、长 TXT）会直接失败而非「慢一点」。</li>\n<li>glibc 的 <code>single-request</code>/<code>single-request-reopen</code> 与 <code>use-vc</code>、<code>trust-ad</code>、<code>no-aaaa</code> 各有明确的适用面，其中 <code>no-aaaa</code> 与 EDNS0/DNSSEC 不兼容，只应作临时诊断。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"存根配置实操：resolv.conf、search/ndots、EDNS0 截断与 TCP 回退","id":"存根配置实操-resolv-conf-search-ndots-edns0-截断与-tcp-回退"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"resolv.conf 关键指令与 glibc 版本差异","id":"resolv-conf-关键指令与-glibc-版本差异"},{"level":2,"text":"search 列表与 ndots:n 的展开算法","id":"search-列表与-ndots-n-的展开算法"},{"level":2,"text":"EDNS0 缓冲协商、TC 截断与 TCP 回退","id":"edns0-缓冲协商-tc-截断与-tcp-回退"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"根/TLD/权威委派、referral 与胶水记录的迭代查询机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dns-resolver-recursive-caching-internals-coredns/dns-resolution-chain-resolver-types/delegation-referral-glue-iteration"},"next":{"title":"缓存键、RRset 存储模型与 TTL 递减/钳制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/dns-resolver-recursive-caching-internals-coredns/caching-ttl-negative-cache/cache-key-rrset-ttl-storage-model"}}